munity.st.com/t5/image/serverpage/image-id/103009i72A461E9E175D07C?v=3Dv2" =
li-image-display-id=3D"'103009i72A461E9E175D07C'" li-message-uid=3D"'780236=
'" li-messages-message-image=3D"true" li-bindable=3D"" class=3D"lia-media-i=
mage" tabindex=3D"0" li-bypass-lightbox-when-linked=3D"true" li-use-hover-l=
inks=3D"false" li-compiled=3D"true"><!----></span></span></p>
<p>Some product datasheets specify <strong><em>gm min</em></strong> while o=
thers&nbsp;<strong><em>Gm<sub>critmax</sub></em></strong><em><sub>.</sub></=
em></p>
<p>Where:&nbsp;</p>
<ol>
<li><strong><em>gm min =3D 5 *&nbsp;Gm<sub>critmax</sub></em></strong>
<p>gm is the oscillator transconductance of the product. Each STM32 product=
