 <a href=3D"https://www.st.com/resource/en/application_note/an2867-guidelin=
es-for-oscillator-design-on-stm8afals-and-stm32-mcusmpus-stmicroelectronics=
.pdf" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">AN2867</a> as <strong><=
em>gm min</em></strong> or <strong><em>Gm<sub>critmax</sub></em></strong></=
p>
