bles.</p>
<h2 id=3D"toc-hId--1566386493">3. Calculation examples</h2>
<p>In this section, we focus on the HSE crystal calculation.<br>The crystal=
 gain margin for LSE is calculated in the same manner but with considering =
the selected drive level.</p>
