class=3D"lia-media-image" tabindex=3D"0" li-bypass-lightbox-when-linked=3D"=
true" li-use-hover-links=3D"false" li-compiled=3D"true"><!----></span></spa=
n></p>
<h2 id=3D"toc-hId--1442269410">Conclusion</h2>
<p>This is a preliminary calculation to confirm that a crystal is or is not=
 suitable for a particular STM32 MCU. Other parameters must also be calcula=
ted. It also highlights the importance of a suitable layout. Please refer t=
o the AN2867 =C2=ABGuidelines for oscillator design on STM8AF/AL/S and STM3=
2 MCUs/MPUs=E2=80=9D application note for more details.&nbsp;</p>
